#: framestackwidget.cpp:47
msgid ""
"<b>Frame stack</b><p>Often referred to as the \"call stack\", this is a list "
"showing which function is currently active and what called each function to "
"get to this point in your program. By clicking on an item you can see the "
"values in any of the previous calling functions."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pila de chamadas</b><p>É unha lista que mostra a función activa e "
"o que chamou cada función para chegar a este punto no programa. Se "
"preme nun ítem pode ver os valores en calquera das funcións previas que "
"fixeron unha chamada."

